{"steam_appid":4156580,"steam_name":"Weed Supermarket Simulator","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4156580/1475490574/3adb73063df7a7db6568ab1ffbd6e20911e3f8c2/1775735367/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1775736020","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257316711/8f412d6de7ff5266f1d0615f4643b9f6553d298e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1775736020","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156580/c56903a5500734a3522976ed09ae397540168494/ss_c56903a5500734a3522976ed09ae397540168494.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786633366","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156580/eaff7f671dca87ed9dad7a552d59ee772a36c9c6/ss_eaff7f671dca87ed9dad7a552d59ee772a36c9c6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786633366","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156580/e82c6279cc38f8dc835bb5f37d46d4cb7851e104/ss_e82c6279cc38f8dc835bb5f37d46d4cb7851e104.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786633366","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156580/26c3c72d116f4ab4007b4e82c6a31fd081239f0c/ss_26c3c72d116f4ab4007b4e82c6a31fd081239f0c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786633366","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156580/2a8ed003d5d0fd1c9e871867ea0228ec2db75365/ss_2a8ed003d5d0fd1c9e871867ea0228ec2db75365.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786633366"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weed Supermarket Simulator</strong> is a chill first-person simulation game where you run your own weed store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open and manage your shop as you sell weed, bongs, and other smoking gear. Set up shelves, display cases, and counters to make shopping easy and fun for all kinds of customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156580/extras/708f93d25315145e16777b13d74da0bf.poster.avif?t=1786633366\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156580/extras/708f93d25315145e16777b13d74da0bf.webm?t=1786633366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156580/extras/708f93d25315145e16777b13d74da0bf.mp4?t=1786633366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your own weed from seed to harvest. Build a grow room, plant seeds, and take care of your plants. Upgrade and improve your strains to create high-quality weed that sells for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156580/extras/f62e5fa6e3d1ae523686f19bd786c376.poster.avif?t=1786633366\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156580/extras/f62e5fa6e3d1ae523686f19bd786c376.webm?t=1786633366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156580/extras/f62e5fa6e3d1ae523686f19bd786c376.mp4?t=1786633366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order weed and supplies on an in-game computer. Get deliveries, unpack boxes, store items in the back room, and place products on shelves, in fridges, or in locked display cases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156580/extras/8710bdf707ec0329f1f848ffbb76ae22.poster.avif?t=1786633366\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156580/extras/8710bdf707ec0329f1f848ffbb76ae22.webm?t=1786633366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156580/extras/8710bdf707ec0329f1f848ffbb76ae22.mp4?t=1786633366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve customers at the counter. Scan items, take cash, and keep everyone happy - or at least nicely high.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your profits to expand your business. Make your shop bigger, improve the interior, unlock new strains, and sell premium products.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156580/extras/30f97afe5e72454a2354e797bb5f692a.poster.avif?t=1786633366\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156580/extras/30f97afe5e72454a2354e797bb5f692a.webm?t=1786633366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156580/extras/30f97afe5e72454a2354e797bb5f692a.mp4?t=1786633366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3-4130 @ 3.3GHz / AMD FX-8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX1050ti / R9 280<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> System Requirements subject to change as development continues</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7-9700 @ 3.6 GHz or Ryzen 5 3600 @ 3.6 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX 3060 or AMD Radeon RX 5700<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 24 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> System Requirements subject to change as development continues</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["DreamWay Games"],"publishers":["PlayWay S.A."],"release_date":"Aug 12, 2026"}